aegis-shell (1.4.0-m2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * M2 surfaces: Control Center (348 px sheet — Wi-Fi/Bluetooth/Calm/Dark
    tiles, Do Not Disturb, Display + Sound sliders, live tier badge wired
    to the effects governor), full-screen Launcher (8x3 glass grid,
    type-to-filter, page dots), notification banners (356x84, stack <= 3,
    org.freedesktop.Notifications compatible), lock screen (118 px thin
    clock, glass password pill, PAM unlock via setuid aegis-auth).
  * Adaptive effects governor (Listing 2): frame-time + battery tier
    machine A<->B<->C, live tier badge, org.aegis.Governor DBus + state
    file for KWin subscribers.
  * Live Activity API: org.aegis.Island (PublishActivity/EndActivity/
    activityAction) with the Table 5b priority stack; island states are
    data rows (timer + generic added); split lobes for two activities;
    shell-owned charging pulse on AC transition.
  * Panel: right half opens Control Center; status cluster (Wi-Fi,
    volume, battery, clock). New CLIs: aegis-lock, aegis-activity.

