aegis-shell (1.4.0-m1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * M1 shell core: 28 px glass panel, floating dock with the §2.2
    magnification recipe (1.85x peak, ±2.4-tile linear falloff, spring
    mass 0.1 / stiffness 170 / damping 13), launch bounce, 120x4 sliver.
  * Dynamic Island: ink capsule morph engine, idle 104x32 (v1.4 override,
    iPhone Pro-class) with all six states of Table 5b.
  * Glass tokens as code (Tokens.qml), KWin blur forced via kwinrulesrc.
  * Session: kwin_wayland + Aegis Shell (wayland-sessions/aegis.desktop).

